,"source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665270-1844751498231509","game_id":"steam-4665270","kind":"announcement","title":"Cosmic Crumbs: Bakery Simulator Demo Launches October 8! 🚀","summary":"The wait is almost over! 🚀 The Cosmic Crumbs: Bakery Simulator Demo will be available on October 8! If you’ve been following the game, the demo is almost here. Very soon, you’ll be able to step into your very own bakery in space and start serving customers among the stars. What can you do in the demo?In the demo, you'll be able to: Run your own space bakeryPrepare pastries and coffeeServe customers and manage the bakery workflowUpgrade your bakery and keep everything running smoothlyPlay solo or","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T13:24:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231509","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:56:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4665270-1841579228669723","game_id":"steam-4665270","kind":"update","title":"Development Update #2 – New Trailer & Major Gameplay Improvements","summary":"Welcome to Development Update #2 for Cosmic Crumbs: Bakery Simulator! A lot has changed since the first development update. Several systems I previously showed as work-in-progress are now fully implemented, while completely new gameplay mechanics have also been added to the bakery. There's also a brand-new trailer showcasing the latest version of Cosmic Crumbs! 🎬 A Brand-New Trailer Cosmic Crumbs has received a new trailer featuring many of the latest gameplay improvements, updated visuals and n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-21T18:22:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a